     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>113</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Use the formula: <span data-math=\"n\\left( {A \\cup B} \\right) = n(A) + n(B) - n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"n\\left( {A \\cup B} \\right) = n(A) + n(B) - n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right) = 35 + 78 - 0 = 113\"></span></p>"
    }
